<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:v="urn:schemas-microsoft-com:vml" xmlns:o="urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office">
<head>
  <title>Jo'barber newsletter</title>
  <!--[if !mso]><!-->
  <meta http-equiv="X-UA-Compatible" content="IE=edge">
  <!--<![endif]-->
  <meta http-equiv="Content-Type" content="text/html; charset=UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <style type="text/css">
    #outlook a {
      padding: 0;
    }
    body {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%;
      -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%;
    }
    table,
    td {
      border-collapse: collapse;
      mso-table-lspace: 0pt;
      mso-table-rspace: 0pt;
    }
    img {
      border: 0;
      height: auto;
      line-height: 100%;
      outline: none;
      text-decoration: none;
      -ms-interpolation-mode: bicubic;
    }
  </style>
  <!--[if mso]>
    <noscript>
      <xml>
        <o:officedocumentsettings>
          <o:allowpng></o:allowpng>
          <o:pixelsperinch>96</o:pixelsperinch>
        </o:officedocumentsettings>
      </xml>
    </noscript>
  <![endif]-->
</head>
<body style="margin: 0 auto; min-width: 100%; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 0;">
  <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="600" align="center" style="width: 100%; max-width: 600px; background-color: #ffffff;" role="none">
    <tr>
      <td style="background-color: #fffffe; text-align: center;">
        <!--[if mso | IE]>
        <table width="600" align="center" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="width: 600px;"><tr><td>
        <![endif]-->
        <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" align="center" style="margin: 0 auto; width: 100%; max-width: 600px; background-color: #ffffff;" role="none">
          {% if newsletter is same as true %}
          <tr>
              <td>
                  <table align="center" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="600" style="width: 100%;" role="none">
                      <tr>
                          <td align="center" style="padding: 12px 20px; text-align: center; font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', sans-serif; font-size: 12px; line-height: 20px; color: #000000;">Si tu as des difficultés pour visualiser ce message, <a href="{{ desktopLink }}" style="color: #000000; text-decoration: underline;">clique ici</a></td>
                      </tr>
                  </table>
              </td>
          </tr>
          {% endif %}
          <tr>
            <td align="center" style="text-align: center;">
              <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" align="center" style="width: 100%;" role="none">
                <tr>
                  <td align="center" style="text-align: center;">
                    <img width="600" src="https://iili.io/BKK75Is.md.png" alt="Jo'barber hero" style="display: block; height: auto; width: 100%; border-width: 0px;" height="auto">
                  </td>
                </tr>
              </table>
            </td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td>
              <table align="center" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="600" style="width: 100%;" role="none">
                <tr>
                  <td align="center" style="padding: 24px 20px; text-align: center; font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', sans-serif; font-size: 24px; line-height: 24px; font-weight: 700; color: #000000;">Votre rendez-vous<br> a été annulé.</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td align="center" style="padding-bottom: 36px; text-align: center; font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 20px; color: #000000;">Malheureusement, <strong>{{ lastName}} {{ firstName }}</strong> a annulé sa coupe de cheveux prévue<br> le <strong>{{ dateTime }}</strong> de <strong>{{ datePeriod }}</strong> au <strong>{{ address }}</strong>.<br> Votre agenda a été mis à jour afin de vous organiser</td>
                </tr>
              </table>
            </td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td>
              <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" align="center" style="width:100%;max-width:600px;padding-top:20px;" role="none">
                <tr>
                  <td align="center">
                    <a href="#href" target="_blank">
                      <img width="600" src="https://iili.io/BKK7ukX.md.png" alt="Jo'barber" style="display: block; height: auto; width: 100%; border-width: 0px;" height="auto">
                    </a>
                  </td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                  <td align="center" style="padding: 8px 20px; text-align: center; font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', sans-serif; font-size: 12px; line-height: 20px; color: #000000;">© Copyright 2026 Jo'barber</td>
                </tr>
              </table>
            </td>
          </tr>
        </table>
        <!--[if mso | IE]>
        </td></tr></table>
        <![endif]-->
      </td>
    </tr>
  </table>
</body>
</html>